  title: {fileID: 269820034}
  descriptions:
  - Press F to switch the flashlight on or off
  - Press N to switch the nightvision goggles on or off. Use the mouse scrollwheel
    to zoom in or out
  - Combine this with the spray can to create a flame thrower. Combine with the rags
    and bottle to create a molotov cocktail
  - Combine with the bottle and lighter to create a molotov cocktail
  - 'Use this to increase your health by 50% '
  - Use these to lower your infection by 25%
  - Drink this to lower your infection by 10% and increase your health by 10%
  - Eat this to increase your stamina to 100%
  - A full battery to power your flashlight
  - A full battery to power your nightvision goggles
  - Required to open all locked doors in the houses
  - ' Required to open all locked doors in the cabins'
  - A full jerry can of fuel for a power generator
